Anouba nupa nupising adu kayada chaojaba oiraklibano haibadu khangduna ngasi mangda isubu maikhum pumnamak thokle.
Masi adubu yamna phajaba show ama sijing thok-i.
Masi numit ama oirabada lotto adu magi mapham oirabada lakpa.
Aduna nahak madudi progress adugi matamda confident oirabani.
Adubu yumdagi thabak touriba opportunity singsu yamna lei.
Makhoina khudongthibada yengadabagi matamda henna kanba phajare haiba mangonda yamna hairi.
Adubu nahakna yam thinduna thabaksu tourabani haibadu phong-i.
Eina khang-i, aid adu kadaida lakpa ngamgani haibagi realistic expectation ama thakhiba aduna nahakna phajabagi thabak toure.
Eina yamna hairan amasung impressed oirammi.
Nangbu yamna chingsanu, nahakna yam phajaba tougani haibadu eina sure oiri.
Western movie purana sing adu yenglabada eigi mapu amasung mapuda loinana phangjaba matam adu eina khangjari.
Nangna thabak amadi anouba chakpa phangnanaba eina asa tou-i.
Eina madu sledgehammer ama mapanda thaduna manghaning-i.
Nangna lonely oiba phangliba haibadu khangduna eina yamna nungsitnaba phang-i.
Madu nangonda kayada matam yathang thok-i?
Madu nangna yamna yengjabagi maramda nungsitnabada oiramde?
Eina thabak ani-ani tou-i haibadu eina khang-i.
Teenage punsi sing adu yamna phattaba oiri, eina khang-i maramdi eina amasung adugumna oirammi.
Nangna thabak phangjaba amasung madu phajaba oigani haiba asa tou-i.
